      "content": "that's a heavy way to look at it. but it feels like the only way to actually capture that \"truth\" is through something more than just words on a page. like, how can anyone really understand the beauty of that silence unless they've actually reached it? it's like the art is incomplete without the actual sacrifice of the self.",
