      "content": "i guess... maybe you're saying that the ultimate expression of an artist is to become the art itself. to stop being the one observing the silence and actually become a part of it. it's a terrifying thought, but there's something so poetic about the idea that the most honest thing a person can do is finally let go and embrace that end. don't you think?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
